  "title": "Volume polynomials and the Heine–Shephard problem",
  "abstract": "The principal results of the included paper characterize volume-polynomial realizability. In dimension d at least three the n-body coefficient locus is semialgebraic exactly for n at most two; the entry includes the polytope clause, forced nonsemialgebraic shapes, and the countable rational quadratic characterization with strict separation, finite certificates, rejection termination and rational polytope reconstruction.",
